File Documentation


Core Module Files

BSK_masters.py
Purpose: Master orchestrator for Basilisk simulations
•	Functionality: 
o	Initializes Basilisk simulation environment
o	Provides base classes BSKSim and BSKScenario
o	Manages simulation execution flow

•	Key Components: 
o	BSKSim: Base simulation class with Basilisk integration
o	BSKScenario: Scenario management with configuration support
•	Connections: Used by all fault modules as parent class

spacecraft_simulation.py
Purpose: Core simulation engine that bridges GUI with Basilisk
•	Functionality: 
o	Creates and configures spacecraft objects
o	Sets up orbital dynamics and gravity
o	Manages fault injection timing
o	Generates visualization data

•	Key Components: 
o	SimulationConfig: Configuration data structure
o	run_custom_simulation(): Main simulation execution
o	inject_fault_into_spacecraft(): Fault injection handler
•	Implementation Details: 
o	Dynamic fault loading with fallback mechanisms
o	Real-time telemetry recording
o	Battery visualization for power faults
o	Multi-satellite support 

spacecraft_simulator_gui.py
Purpose: Main GUI application using Tkinter
•	Functionality: 
o	Provides user interface for all simulation features
o	Manages application state and data
o	Coordinates between different GUI tabs
o	Handles simulation execution in separate thread

•	Key Components: 
o	SatelliteSimulatorApp: Main application class
o	Tab management system
o	Event handling and callbacks
•	Implementation Details: 
o	Non-blocking simulation execution
o	Real-time status updates
o	Configuration import/export
o	Integrated help system

fault_loader.py
Purpose: Dynamic fault module loading system
•	Functionality: 
o	Discovers available fault modules at runtime
o	Provides unified interface for fault execution
o	Handles fault data extraction for plotting
o	Manages fault scenario execution

•	Key Components: 
o	get_fault_scenario_class(): Dynamic class loading
o	run_scenario(): Unified execution interface
o	extract_fault_data_from_scenario(): Data extraction
•	Implementation Details: 
o	Plugin architecture for extensibility
o	Graceful fallback for missing modules
o	Parameter passing to fault scenarios
o	Support for both legacy and new interfaces

plots.py
Purpose: Centralized plotting engine for all visualizations
•	Functionality: 
o	Generates fault-specific plots
o	Creates constellation visualizations
o	Produces inter-satellite distance analysis
o	Interfaces with real fault simulations

•	Key Components: 
o	generate_fault_plots(): Fault visualization dispatcher
o	generate_constellation_plots(): Orbital visualization
o	generate_inter_satellite_distance_plots(): Formation analysis
•	Implementation Details: 
o	Attempts real simulation data when available
o	Falls back to synthetic data if needed
o	Matplotlib-based rendering
o	Automatic plot categorization


