Contributing
Adding New Fault Types
1.	Create new module in faults/ directory
2.	Inherit from BSKScenario class
3.	Implement required methods: 
o	__init__(): Initialize parameters
o	inject_fault(): Apply fault to dynamics
o	pull_outputs(): Generate plots
4.	Register in fault_loader.py

Extending GUI Features
1.	Create new tab class inheriting from BaseTab
2.	Implement UI creation in create_tab_ui()
3.	Add to main GUI in spacecraft_simulator_gui.py
4.	Update help documentation

